/*
 * Declares the ArrayAccessValue class.
 *
 * ArrayAccessValue represents an indexed access on an array value. The operator
 * applies an index expression to an array operand and produces the element at
 * the given position. Bounds checking and runtime access semantics are handled
 * by the generator and runtime according to the array type.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::slice::arrayaccess
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/slice/arrayaccess.yr
